<main>
<div id="content-container">
	<h1> Cookbook of the Month: October 2025</h1>
	<article>
	<div class="imagetextcolumn"><div class="clearfix"><img src="../images/moreismore.jpg" width="550px" height="665px" alt="red cookbook cover with More is More in whote bubble letters and picture of a women sitting on the kitchen counter eating onion rings">
	<h2> More is More: Get Loose in the Kitchen</h2>
	<h3>by: Molly Baz</h3>
	<h4>Murdoch Books Pty Limited, 2023</h4>
	<h4>304 pages</h4>
	
	<ul class="nobullets"> 
		<li><b>Subject:</b> Cooking, General</li>
		<li><b>Cooking Level:</b> Novice to Advanced</li>
	</ul>
	<p> Molly Baz takes a maximalist approach to cooking in her latest cookbook More is More. With over 100 flavour-packed recipes More is More encourages readers to take more risks in the kitchen and to cook with confidence. Recipes include breakfasts, lunches, snacks, salads, dinners, and desserts, and are ideal for both weeknight cooking and special occasions.</p>
	<p><b>Why we love it:</b> Molly’s philosophy of finding joy in the kitchen shines through in every single recipe. Her exuberance is infectious and every bite she produces is both delicious and achievable even for the most novice cook.</p>
	<p><b>Our Favourite Recipes:</b></p>
		<ul>
			<li>Marinated Zucchini &amp; Mozz, <i>pg. 90</i></li>
			<li>Shells, Peas, and Buttermilk, <i>pg. 104</i></li>
			<li>Last Meal Scallops, <i>pg. 174</i></li>
			<li>Maple Ricotta Munchkins, <i>pg. 280</i></li>
			
		</ul>
	<div class="buttonblue"><a href="https://www.google.ca/books/edition/More_Is_More/clOpEAAAQBAJ?hl=en&gbpv=1&dq=more+is+more+molly+baz&printsec=frontcover" target="_blank">Preview on Google Books</a></div>					  
</div></div>
	</article>

